  "priorExpiration": "1996-12-22",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "We 701.01 Purpose. The purpose of We 700 is to:\n\n(a) Protect the groundwater of the state and supplied groundwater of the state from contamination resulting from improper pump installation or repair; and\n\n(b) Protect the consuming public from hardship, resulting from improper pump installation or repair.\n\nSource. #4198, eff 1-5-87; ss by #4730, eff 1-15-90; ss by #4898, eff 8-13-90; EXPIRED: 8-13-96\n\nNew. #6327, INTERIM, eff 8-24-96, EXPIRED: 12-22-96\n\nNew. #6449, eff 1-29-97; ss by #7307, eff 6-13-00; ss by #9179, eff 6-13-08; ss by #12083, eff 3-1-17 (See Revision Notes at Chapter headings for We 300 and We 600)",
